      "id": "claim_ef3297a9f23c4c2e9e62f8bced401485",
      "statement": "The node-log tier's one peer-POST boundary is the LogTransport trait used by the log routes, and its design documents a scheduler-controlled replacement transport for the simulator, so follower entry codecs are deterministic and shared with simulation.",
      "evidence": [
