      "statement": "/runtime/ is the operator CLIs' way in (celld d1, kv, queue, workflows): the same forwarding dispatch /do/ uses but with the fleet authentication /do/ does not have, and it serves only reserved runtime classes, refusing a plain Durable Object scope with 403 directing the caller to /do/.",
